==Languages this set is released in==
The Dark Rush set is released in Japanese and Korean. The Japanese set is only available in 1st edition, and the Korean set is only available in unlimited edition. The Dark Explorers set is released in English, German, French, Italian, and Portuguese, with cards also available as Reverse Holos (with the exception of the Portuguese set, which lacked Reverse Holos).

